# Build outputs beside a world file: the store (graph.md 3.2, build.md 13: `.via/store/`) and the
# default build directory (build.md 14: `--out` defaults to `build/<name>` beside the world file).
# Anchored to where world files live, so a spec folder named after the build chapter
# (spec/vectors/build/) stays tracked.
.via/
/examples/**/build/
/spec/vectors/*/**/build/
